    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bbc1aa3e2558b3f1d6e1622",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是明天的美丽～☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5878ce0478e86688b4323fdf7e7e28624db35673d5230c453cd272108dba62e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18a4f92cb4572a5c972c998a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "进入疲惫模式啦……！\r\n但这也就代表着\r\n我有多努力了对吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3855ede7e7308fe5d8a6db28ae7d9c78c4ac925a3ab0733ec0a4026454021efb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7dd87d9612308c7c6edd211",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "内心非常美丽～～☆★\r\n……可是身体却动弹不得～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9838700c118cb231708798f67a11d19a95ad7a975184cf4236b673bfae53b925",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9d0495fa0797ec512c8ba0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈哈，美丽～☆★\r\n不论心情还是状态都美丽！\r\n出发去寻找新的美丽吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc79307913aa45a7ed75861af0a1da7252d3c22aec19143bb0122ceea647f987",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b34306bec05d36fa94e9d472",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在要做什么？做什么好呢？\r\n不管做什么都开心！都高兴！\r\n持续奔跑到深夜吧～☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "787e360f399da2f2bdd18d4f7e45e240f52c6e7f4c3dcf0e295eb29896cc7de8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39016f6e47ddea15a0e62a3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也能够进行训练！\r\n这件理所当然的事，\r\n胜过一切的恩惠呢☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c9b01fede9052f4bd44027ccb92ee5e383128a84697e2a08bfa6d6dc3c530a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adc6df28715bcc4f3905a166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训、训、训训训练♪\r\n并跑练习、坡道♪重训、拖轮胎！\r\n美好的我正在前方等待着～☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9f46ab409c740cd68619abcd146f72e0b8a9f003f9cec9f7911e8bbd29e46b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3caef3f99dab19a2be6282fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始训练啦～☆耶嘿嘿，\r\n训练员安排的训练排程总是让我\r\n雀跃无比又心跳加速★真期待～☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f6fd7db8b304bdac53ca6feb547093790b2f63ca0d9945fecaff22f01dca0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399c34eaf0ac4d5474df1db0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来比赛吧～☆东张西望～★\r\n看谁能在训练时发现最多美丽！\r\nGo──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d66408ee5cc83133c5b317c5669fd40c7187c23572068d6d8475afff7d00fcd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79fedfd8cfbf04a3a82ce160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～总觉得提不起精神耶？\r\n但只要成功克服这个难关，\r\n是不是就能变得更美丽呢☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a3719f2bf96086e6cfa59ebaf1bd12940a79a32afe29b7462369ff5619a092d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0534ebb334db8c67f4a2c457",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "问你哦，我可不可以去散步呢？\r\n我觉得美丽不太够耶……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a142808aa3cdfae191d3017d4288f9fcc246dbce4ce407471b2f418c68aa64fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee1416b6a33abf1f449def49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想吃奶奶做的日式馒头！\r\n枫叶形状的，有很多种内馅……\r\n在这种日子里吃，会特别美味呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf5b45b7b6ad6af2b350910e840169a2063003c9e14e5f85318df0fe603b38b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb9945074a12d12cb8ec085",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "────啊，\r\n亮晶晶在呼唤我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b66181734f37cbbbe595aa83c4c8d220753c5ddf7a3229cd6d799d04274c687e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6911d34964809f8981384bdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好休息不要急躁，\r\n也是迎向美丽未来的必备条件哦☆\r\n就依照我们的步调来做吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a8b550ac0c1b97f52944bfba4839040d703086136df7325da6004d0cff76708",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7628ce7a7f5cd7f4e8c78de0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么什么？竞赛？真的吗？\r\n我怎么有股会发生意外的\r\n预感耶～～？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d44b6c72b95506c947298a71e3ff5184af834706c02824716359f11c6da1f43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c36f747f5cb8e9ec7867b5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是美丽竞赛日☆★\r\n以完美的状态迎接美好的日子！\r\n非常感谢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6023b0bcd095ae7a53d6e0ad6e53ad803fe4b511892d29f82c4199e4a8a2b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d422af1464102b2b65bebb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都很美丽☆★☆\r\n互相竞争、彼此认同！\r\n朝着远方的顶点勇往直前～☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "d66ad8749fe2387940a323f1a3c4a8cbf4d40be6f4f597a9fe3a0829657302ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d98f5c001c86e988fa72b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶～耶～要比赛，要比赛了耶！\r\n准备完美无缺，厕所也去过了☆\r\n我今天能比谁都美丽地奔驰唷★",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d062cdb1d2ed2cb60b8a66560a18d967cacf1dbf947f37ab3067a7b0d313a1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:395b5f2abfb9c43d1e0807bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竞赛是美丽的种子！\r\n今天也要让很～多美丽\r\n绽放开来哦☆★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "79b7bf83bd497223851ecb47a062518e28e9e25761d25bd4195b4929be2d9551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45fdd79e8ceee1b509699349",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你看好啰！\r\n我会完美展现我们两个\r\n一起打造的美丽☆★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd83433361acbe22650283fa9cbf0427271dcd07350f53f6644ee56b757ea3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee6180c59db4eea9c66e342d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态绝佳☆蝴蝶结也系好★\r\n我要去靠着奶奶送给我的赤红力量，\r\n咻～！地一声冲过赛场啰☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "579ce99b220886fa8e5eddf027c51de4d07b26ab4bf1a287810ce27e5b5ae429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb84241bd80d662bdaddf1ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奶奶她啊，说会收看电视呢！\r\n呵呵呵～必须让奶奶\r\n看见我美丽的表现才行☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "cea94fb6f84e4a90586bf691b51fe9c5d83d664aa81de4599043b572b832c14e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83fd2828de6fcf3c7b36d225",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断努力♪努力♪努力♪再努力☆★\r\n我一路上已经累积很多的实力了！\r\n应该能跑出一场很出色的竞赛☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ecb895e77753ea6fe20862dc893bb3da95655eb1c7220dde0a19251789bfc6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f1b161936521a02e49213b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈，终于要进行竞赛了☆★\r\n会发生什么呢？赛况会是如何呢？\r\n没有人知道，真的好期待呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd965af63d63d49a2ab28ccfe28d1c58e8a585202e497f7dd277e984c4cc94e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccdb7dfc00e5103c080c8839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈，活力只剩下一点点！\r\n但或许这是个转机！？\r\n美丽的挑战──☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "593afd7513ca0d3a705beccfa1febb1c51112ff830b481b4e912156cb9135900",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc7ab0b63b1c01be253517e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "永不放弃☆★\r\n我要把此刻能发挥的力量发挥殆尽！\r\n因为那样做比较美丽嘛☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "57af195efad6a58eb9a9637b5cdc7bb39cde681a7344874fe88a9ca77483bb94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d49ff886644dc5acfd2d4c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，该出去亮相圈了……啊！\r\n是关东煮摊贩耶☆还有甜甜圈★\r\n……奇怪？我们刚才在讲什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c343de913252fc1f6d4e397d803f38fe397e44e65ea85dccd22d2edb1f378675",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9a38043fb5e7702322b7bbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害好厉害！状况简～～直……！\r\n差到不行啦～～啊哈哈哈～～☆\r\n我能发挥多少实力呢～？？挑战～★",
      "source_fingerprint": "236544badd61d9d81f8cd978c507942942285b338ffd52a826844708208ada82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eac5c3efa28ac902fbc5f5a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与其哭丧着一张脸，不如摆出\r\n美丽的表情吧！这一路上能做的事\r\n我们都做了嘛☆一定没问题的唷★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60b7e648d15794972a64fa2bb1c9582b3642974cf5fd122fefbe9800fd643a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfab71246f403e20550470a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种时候才更该喊出……美丽～☆★\r\n若想要将美丽呼唤而来，\r\n表现出接纳的态度也很重要哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1556ae8d3a5bc1c988c8ace7c64a7df75124f93df0277f49989ea5074dbdfa43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
